Student Database
This C program stores student details in data.txt. Use the menu to save student records, display saved records, remove the last record, or exit.
Each record contains:
- University name
- Student’s full name
- Street and city
- Year of study

Important notes
- Saving opens data.txt in write mode, so it replaces any records already in the file.
- The remove option rewrites the file without its last student record.
- The file format uses commas between fields, so names and addresses should not contain commas.
- The remove function stores records in an array limited to 100 students.
